<h2>Flood, water intrusion, and mold claims</h2>
<p>Water losses are among the most misunderstood claims, and Southeast Texas sees more than its share. Harvey in 2017 and Imelda in 2019 both brought extreme rainfall to Jefferson County. Coverage often depends on where the water came from and how quickly the damage happened. We assist with:</p>
